Author:         see list of sites below
Original-site:  see list of sites below
Copying-policy: see list of sites below
Size: 856KB
Extension_by:   juanito
Tags:           av upnp streaming media
Comments:       a collection of DLNA (UPnP AV) services, implemented through a
                plug-in mechanism
                ----------
                can optionally use gtk4 for rygel-preferences
                ----------
                Howto:
                verify gst-launch-1.0 playbin uri=file:///mnt/path/test.mp3 works
                edit ~/.config/rygel.conf with the location of your files, or
                use xdg-user-dirs-update
                $ rygel & [to stream av files]
                add ~/.config/rygel.conf to your backup
                ----------
                gupnp-av-cp from gupnp-tools can be used to play/view images,
                music and videos or use your tv, music streamer, etc
